    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_i_s_a_g_a_log_compactor" kindref="compound">ISAGALogCompactor</ref> adapter backed by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_s_a_g_a_log_compactor" kindref="compound">SAGALogCompactor</ref> and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_s_a_g_a_log_replayer" kindref="compound">SAGALogReplayer</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_s_a_g_a_log_compactor_adapter_1a94abd487eeb17d1681d8720867ce2f21" kindref="member">compact()</ref> launches the compaction on a background thread and returns a future. <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_s_a_g_a_log_compactor_adapter_1a23e7ca5a53fcbe841f2e39d8c2580795" kindref="member">replay()</ref> reads all entries for the given segment ID into memory and returns a <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_vector_replay_iterator" kindref="compound">VectorReplayIterator</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
